# 💼 Career Center

> Career Center is the education and career hub of the DreamVerse Universe. Here, players learn skills, earn certificates, gain experience, and unlock careers that connect with every major DreamVerse game.

---

# 💼 Name

✅ **Career Center** (Final)

Other Ideas:
- CareerVerse
- Skill Hub
- Future Academy
- Job Center

---

# 🎯 Main Purpose

Career Center is not just a school.

It prepares players for real jobs inside DreamVerse.

Players can:

🎓 Learn Skills

📜 Earn Certificates

💼 Apply for Jobs

📈 Gain Experience

🏆 Unlock Better Careers

🌍 Work across the DreamVerse Universe

